            PRINTFORMW You convince %CALLNAME:TGC_LookingAt% to surrender to you.
            PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TGC_LookingAt% drops %HIS_HER(TGC_LookingAt)% weapon and places both of %HIS_HER(TGC_LookingAt)% hands up.
            PRINTFORM %CALLNAME:(TGC_CurrentAttacker)%, glad to see that %CALLNAME:TGC_LookingAt% has surrendered, 
            PRINTFORML uses %HIM_HER(TGC_LookingAt)%...
            ;FLAG:796 = 1
